<title>USA: Krantor sees no reason for shr decline.</title>
<headline>Krantor sees no reason for shr decline.</headline>
<dateline>DEER PARK, N.Y. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Krantor Corp said Tuesday that it knows of no fundamental business reason for the decline in the price of the company's common stock on Monday, June 2.</p>
<p>On Monday the stock fell 11/32 to 13/16 on unusually heavy volume.</p>
<p>The company said it anticipates a continuation of its profitability at the same and higher levels as the year progresses.</p>
</text>
